      // §M2c-2). Collect a Stream[Int] of byte codes into a String, e.g. to
      // build a response body. Synthesized as `let parts = []; while i <
      // length(bs) { Array::push(parts, String::from_char_code(bs[i])); i = i +
      // 1 }; String::join(parts, "")` and lowered via `ce`. Pushing one-char
